{
  "slug": "alloydb",
  "name": "Alloydb",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Create, connect, and interact with an AlloyDB for PostgreSQL database and data.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `alloydb-postgres`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install alloydb@claude-plugins-official` from `gemini-cli-extensions/alloydb`.\n\nThis repository packages MCP Toolbox's prebuilt `alloydb-postgres` server as a plugin/extension to interact with AlloyDB for PostgreSQL instances. It can be used with various AI agents, including Antigravity, Claude Code and Codex, to manage your databases, execute queries, explore schemas, and troubleshoot issues using natural language prompts.",
